# Phase 3 (root .dockerignore): keep secrets, VCS history and local caches OUT
# of every image build context. Without this, a `COPY . .` in any service
# Dockerfile could bake .env files or the full .git history into the image.
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*

# Python caches / local venvs
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Node local installs + build caches (images run a clean install)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/npm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS cruft + logs
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
